    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Dungeon is a roguelike card game. Win every battle using only the cards in your opening hand to defeat all enemies in a single turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using as few cards as possible will earn you more rewards, and if you get stuck on an enemy, you can use money to shuffle and draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your deck using the money you earn! Defeat stronger enemies to earn more money! Repeat this process until you clear the dungeon!</p>",
